WEBVTT

00:07.710 --> 00:12.420
<b>In 2013, a secret research group at CERN</b>

00:12.510 --> 00:16.510
<b>discovered a quantum particle
called Exotic Matter.</b>

00:17.350 --> 00:22.730
<b>XM affects the mind in polarizing ways,
and may have been doing so for millennia.</b>

00:23.890 --> 00:27.440
<b>Covert organizations began unlocking
XM’s power. Two Factions emerged.</b>

00:28.060 --> 00:31.480
<b>The Enlightened see XM
as the path to a new era.</b>

00:31.900 --> 00:34.110
<b>The Resistance as a threat we must stop.</b>

00:36.610 --> 00:39.280
<b>We’re exposed here, I don’t like it.</b>

00:40.160 --> 00:42.250
<b>Some risk is necessary.</b>

00:43.040 --> 00:44.710
<b>Why’re we here? Why Hulong?</b>

00:47.000 --> 00:48.630
<b>To save humanity from itself.</b>

00:51.920 --> 00:55.130
<b>What I’m about to show you
is extremely sensitive.</b>

00:56.300 --> 01:00.510
<b>No matter what happens,
assume everyone is against you.</b>

01:00.600 --> 01:01.930
<b>Even the Resistance?</b>

01:02.520 --> 01:04.520
<b>Betrayal can come from anywhere</b>

01:06.140 --> 01:08.690
<b>We have to find and protect
this woman quickly.</b>

01:11.150 --> 01:11.980
<b>Who is she?</b>

01:12.360 --> 01:15.780
<b>Sarah Coppola... Hulong researcher...</b>

01:20.240 --> 01:21.080
<b>Hulong! Get down!</b>

01:41.180 --> 01:42.010
<b>Let’s move!</b>

01:46.890 --> 01:47.850
<b>We have the target.</b>

02:10.460 --> 02:12.540
<b><i>Alpha, bring the target to the lab.</i></b>

02:13.090 --> 02:15.300
<b><i>-Bravo, go after the Agent.</i>
-Roger!</b>

02:40.740 --> 02:42.950
<b>Spread out!
She’s in here somewhere!</b>

02:49.120 --> 02:50.750
<b>Anyone there...
the world is in danger...</b>

02:52.210 --> 02:53.630
<b>Found her! You!
Don't move!</b>

02:58.550 --> 02:59.420
<b>Hey! Got her!</b>

03:07.890 --> 03:10.640
<b>We all thought you were
such a promising researcher.</b>

03:11.350 --> 03:12.560
<b>How unfortunate.</b>

03:13.190 --> 03:15.570
<b>What were you even thinking?</b>

03:16.070 --> 03:19.190
<b>You’re research is... tainted data.</b>

03:19.940 --> 03:24.450
<b>Whatever it was, it wasn’t XM...
it was dark...</b>

03:27.040 --> 03:30.410
<b>Your false sense of righteousness
has let you down.</b>

03:33.960 --> 03:37.170
<b>Sarah, we’ve got your accomplice too.</b>

03:38.210 --> 03:40.300
<b>Tell us your plan and we’ll go easy.</b>

03:41.300 --> 03:43.050
<b>What exactly are you two after?</b>

03:45.800 --> 03:46.640
<b>Who are you?</b>

03:47.430 --> 03:51.520
<b>You don’t know me yet Sarah,
but I know you very well.</b>

03:52.730 --> 03:55.810
<b>You are far more special
than you ever thought you were.</b>

03:56.650 --> 04:01.110
<b>You see the unseen, Sarah.
You know that something is very wrong.</b>

04:01.740 --> 04:02.780
<b>Stop!</b>

04:03.400 --> 04:05.070
<b>Why are you saying this?</b>

04:06.910 --> 04:09.870
<b>This isn’t how I imagined meeting,
but fate doesn’t negotiate.</b>

04:10.660 --> 04:13.580
<b>I am here to guide you, Sensitive.
Watch carefully.</b>

04:16.420 --> 04:18.500
<b>Trust what you feel, not what you see.</b>

04:20.260 --> 04:23.220
<b>You discovered the truth
and they tried to stop you.</b>

04:23.800 --> 04:27.470
<b>But you will not be stopped.
There is so much more for you to do.</b>

04:28.140 --> 04:30.430
<b>-What's he talking about?
-Contain him!</b>

04:30.810 --> 04:33.730
<b>The world around you is not what it seems.</b>

04:34.350 --> 04:38.940
<b>But you know what it can become, Sarah,
and how to lead it there.</b>

04:39.900 --> 04:42.190
<b>Destruction leads to creation.</b>

04:42.940 --> 04:45.530
<b>Remember that in the times to come.</b>

04:51.910 --> 04:55.210
<b><i>No!</i></b>

05:01.590 --> 05:06.220
<b><i>Log in to Ingress, Agent.</i>
<i>It’s time to move.</i></b>

06:42.440 --> 06:45.360
<b>What’s Hulong’s explanation for
an explosion of this scale?</b>

06:45.690 --> 06:47.280
<b>Just a faulty gas line. That’s all.</b>

06:47.690 --> 06:50.360
<b>What about the rumors that your
company’s experiments caused this?</b>

06:50.450 --> 06:53.830
<b>-This place got blown to hell.
-I'm telling you that's not the case.</b>

06:53.910 --> 06:58.250
<b>-Are you saying this was an accident?
-Uh, consultant. Passing through.</b>

06:58.330 --> 07:01.370
<b>-Please, just remain here.
-We're fortunate there were no casualties.</b>

07:02.080 --> 07:06.920
<b>Just a gas leak, huh?
Sounds like someone else’s problem to me.</b>

07:07.630 --> 07:12.220
<b>I wouldn’t be so sure about that, sir.
Not seeing any traces of a gas leak.</b>

07:14.260 --> 07:17.310
<b>And the only witness to this fiasco
is out cold...</b>

07:18.020 --> 07:20.020
<b>Shouldn’t we get her to the hospital?</b>

07:20.100 --> 07:23.310
<b>Her brainwaves, pulse,
and respiration are all normal.</b>

07:23.860 --> 07:28.150
<b>Besides, she’s the closest thing
to a lead we have. We need her.</b>

07:36.830 --> 07:37.870
<b>Hold it. Hey!</b>

07:38.620 --> 07:41.040
<b>This area’s restricted
to authorized personnel.</b>

07:41.120 --> 07:43.330
<b>Yeah, but... I'm supposed to...</b>

07:43.670 --> 07:44.500
<b>Hey.</b>

07:45.080 --> 07:47.630
<b>Let him through. He’s a contractor.</b>

07:48.000 --> 07:49.210
<b>Yeah... what he said.</b>

07:53.510 --> 07:56.680
<b>Sorry it’s so late,
but welcome to the circus, Makoto.</b>

07:58.510 --> 08:01.810
<b>Oh, right. Midorikawa. Makoto Midorikawa.</b>

08:02.350 --> 08:03.640
<b>It’s... nice to meet you.</b>

08:04.520 --> 08:06.110
<b>Yeah, likewise.</b>

08:07.400 --> 08:08.650
<b>What happened?</b>

08:08.980 --> 08:09.820
<b>Right. Well...</b>

08:10.440 --> 08:14.610
<b>You can see the place is burnt to a crisp.
We just don’t know why.</b>

08:14.700 --> 08:18.330
<b>Okay, understood.
Glove coming off.</b>

08:18.410 --> 08:19.580
<b>Yeah. Do your thing.</b>

08:21.080 --> 08:21.910
<b>And he’s...</b>

08:22.370 --> 08:26.460
<b>A special investigator.
We’re trying him out. For now, at least.</b>

08:26.540 --> 08:28.960
<b>Special investigator? That kid?</b>

08:29.750 --> 08:34.050
<b>I know... apparently he sees memories of
whatever object he touches.</b>

08:34.590 --> 08:37.010
<b>Objects don’t have memories.
Gimme a break.</b>

08:37.090 --> 08:39.680
<b>A “psychic investigator.”</b>

08:40.100 --> 08:44.440
<b>That's what they’d call him in America.
He’s cracked a few cases already.</b>

09:00.620 --> 09:02.580
<b>What's wrong?
Did you see something?</b>

09:03.910 --> 09:05.870
<b>They all just... burned up!
No... vanished.</b>

09:07.210 --> 09:08.130
<b>Why not her?</b>

09:11.340 --> 09:12.550
<b>Is this guy all there?</b>

09:15.380 --> 09:17.550
<b>We haven’t found a trace of human remains.</b>

09:18.300 --> 09:20.680
<b>Even if they were burned,
there’d at least be some bone.</b>

09:22.770 --> 09:24.060
<b>-Hold it. Hey!
-Get back!</b>

09:24.980 --> 09:28.850
<b>Thank you for your hard work, detectives,
but it’s time for you to leave.</b>

09:29.560 --> 09:30.400
<b>What?</b>

09:30.650 --> 09:33.320
<b>This matter is now Hulong
Corporate Security jurisdiction.</b>

09:37.570 --> 09:38.410
<b>Who's this?</b>

10:04.020 --> 10:04.850
<b>My God.</b>

10:06.930 --> 10:07.770
<b>Pack it up!</b>

10:08.230 --> 10:11.060
<b>Huh? Really?
What was that call about?</b>

10:11.520 --> 10:13.820
<b>Orders straight from the Director General.</b>

10:13.900 --> 10:15.280
<b>-The Director...
-Let's go!</b>

10:15.530 --> 10:16.610
<b>Uh... what?</b>

10:17.070 --> 10:20.240
<b>-Go on. Your work here is over!
-Clear out.</b>

10:49.390 --> 10:50.900
<b>Sarah Coppola... She survived.</b>

11:15.880 --> 11:19.510
<b>The hell was that?
Acting like we’re in their way...</b>

11:19.970 --> 11:21.970
<b>They’re making it clear we’re not wanted.</b>

11:22.640 --> 11:25.430
<b>Makoto... sorry we wasted your time, kid.</b>

11:26.100 --> 11:28.930
<b>But since you’re here, why don’t we
grab a drink, huh? I’m buying.</b>

11:29.020 --> 11:32.020
<b>Uh, sorry, I have plans...</b>

11:32.400 --> 11:35.690
<b>Sure you do.
We’ll grab a drink one of these days, kid.</b>

11:36.150 --> 11:38.360
<b>Enjoy those “plans” Makoto.
See you around.</b>

11:39.240 --> 11:42.320
<b>Hang on, Inspector. Really...
How long have you known this kid?</b>

11:42.410 --> 11:46.410
<b>-We have a history. Come, drinks on me.
-This I’ve gotta hear.</b>

12:11.850 --> 12:12.690
<b>Ouch!</b>

12:13.520 --> 12:14.350
<b>Come on...</b>

12:24.280 --> 12:25.110
<b>No!</b>

12:25.200 --> 12:27.580
<b>-Hey!
-It’s just... he sees my memories.</b>

12:28.120 --> 12:29.740
<b>Come on, Makoto! Over here!</b>

12:29.830 --> 12:31.200
<b>-Let's go!
-Wait for me!</b>

12:32.870 --> 12:34.460
<b>Oh no... It’s happening again.</b>

12:34.750 --> 12:36.420
<b>-What is that?
-It's creepy.</b>

12:36.880 --> 12:38.790
<b>What’s his deal?
Is he crazy or something?</b>

12:39.090 --> 12:42.090
<b>-My mom said not to get too close.
-Weirdo...</b>

12:59.900 --> 13:02.320
<b>How is something like that even possible?</b>

13:06.610 --> 13:07.740
<b>EXPLOSION AT HULONG LAB</b>

13:12.120 --> 13:12.950
<b>POSSIBLE GAS LEAK</b>

13:13.040 --> 13:16.000
<b>They’re calling it a gas explosion?
Why cover it up?</b>

13:16.670 --> 13:18.290
<b>This is getting interesting...</b>

13:19.840 --> 13:20.670
<b>Who are they?</b>

13:20.750 --> 13:25.720
<b>ANYONE GOT INFO ABOUT EXPLOSION
AT HULONG TOKYO?</b>

13:28.430 --> 13:29.760
<b><i>SOMETHING IS VERY WRONG.</i></b>

13:34.060 --> 13:35.980
<b><i>THE WORLD IS NOT AS IT SEEMS.</i></b>

13:36.890 --> 13:37.730
<b>A virus?</b>

13:38.230 --> 13:40.150
<b><i>AND IT IS IN DANGER.</i></b>

13:42.110 --> 13:42.940
<b>Sarah...</b>

13:46.360 --> 13:48.780
<b><i>ONLY YOU CAN HELP.</i></b>

13:50.620 --> 13:53.370
<b>WHO IS THIS? WHAT AM I HELPING?</b>

13:53.870 --> 13:55.910
<b><i>IT'S TIME TO MOVE.</i></b>

14:01.040 --> 14:02.500
<b>What is this app?</b>

14:04.130 --> 14:05.800
<b><i>THIS IS NOT A GAME.</i></b>

14:05.880 --> 14:07.380
<b>OK, then what is it?</b>

14:08.130 --> 14:09.680
<b><i>THIS IS YOUR FIRST PORTAL.</i></b>

14:09.760 --> 14:12.180
<b><i>PORTAL.</i></b>

14:12.510 --> 14:14.180
<b><i>HURRY OR THE WORLD...</i></b>

14:19.140 --> 14:23.900
<b>TOKYO MEDLAB HOSPITAL</b>

14:33.830 --> 14:35.580
<b>It looks abandoned...</b>

14:40.290 --> 14:41.710
<b>Hope the door’s unlocked.</b>

15:16.950 --> 15:19.160
<b>Why did Brandt want me to protect you?</b>

15:25.040 --> 15:26.880
<b>You again. You’re here.</b>

15:32.380 --> 15:33.590
<b>Were you messaging me?</b>

15:35.470 --> 15:37.470
<b>Or are you actually... asleep?</b>

15:40.640 --> 15:43.350
<b>Okay... what’s your deal?</b>

15:50.400 --> 15:52.150
<b>Hang on a second! Let me explain!</b>

15:52.240 --> 15:54.110
<b>Shut up. I’m doing the talking.</b>

15:54.950 --> 15:58.290
<b>What happened to Christopher Brandt?
What happened at the lab?</b>

15:58.830 --> 16:01.620
<b>Christopher Brandt?
I... I don’t know him!</b>

16:01.710 --> 16:04.210
<b>If you don’t know him
then why are you here?</b>

16:04.880 --> 16:07.800
<b>Do not test me. I will end you right now.</b>

16:08.710 --> 16:11.300
<b>I came here because... she asked me too.</b>

16:11.380 --> 16:15.970
<b>Coma girl gave you a call?
You’re gonna need a better lie.</b>

16:17.760 --> 16:19.140
<b>I’m not... lying! She...</b>

16:19.890 --> 16:21.390
<b>Told me... check my phone...</b>

16:34.490 --> 16:36.950
<b>Do I... know you somehow?</b>

16:38.330 --> 16:39.160
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

16:39.830 --> 16:40.790
<b>There’s someone here!</b>

16:41.290 --> 16:42.450
<b>L-Let's go!</b>

16:43.160 --> 16:44.210
<b>I’ll go check it out</b>

16:45.580 --> 16:46.420
<b>Okay.</b>

16:47.750 --> 16:48.590
<b>No! Sarah!</b>

16:54.880 --> 16:55.930
<b>Who are you, anyway?</b>

16:56.510 --> 16:59.220
<b>Huh? O-Oh, Makoto. I mean, I’m Makoto.</b>

16:59.810 --> 17:01.140
<b>And why are you helping me?</b>

17:01.520 --> 17:04.480
<b>Good question.
I haven’t really figured that yet.</b>

17:05.440 --> 17:08.060
<b>Who in the world are you?
Why is everyone after you?</b>

17:11.820 --> 17:12.740
<b>You tell me.</b>

17:14.070 --> 17:16.450
<b>I can’t remember.
I can’t remember anything.</b>

17:17.320 --> 17:19.700
<b>You have... amnesia.</b>

17:23.330 --> 17:24.710
<b>HULONG TOKYO RESEARCH LAB</b>

17:25.040 --> 17:26.870
<b>Hulong?
You want me to go back there?</b>

17:28.380 --> 17:30.960
<b>Guess you’re not sending these.</b>

17:32.210 --> 17:34.880
<b>Then who is?
And what do they want?</b>

17:38.680 --> 17:41.180
<b>Let’s head to Hulong.
It might help with that amnesia.</b>

17:41.260 --> 17:42.560
<b>Uh... Ok...</b>

17:46.310 --> 17:47.140
<b>Sarah.</b>

17:48.480 --> 17:50.610
<b>That’s your name. Sarah.</b>

17:51.980 --> 17:55.440
<b>Right now that’s all I know,
but there’s more there... trust me.</b>

17:56.780 --> 17:57.610
<b>Okay.</b>

18:09.580 --> 18:12.800
<b>Hulong’s Lab. The site of the explosion.
Remember anything?</b>

18:18.880 --> 18:19.720
<b>Hey, Sarah?</b>

18:27.980 --> 18:30.020
<b>Huh? What the hell is this?</b>

18:41.740 --> 18:42.870
<b>I remember...</b>

18:44.740 --> 18:47.080
<b>I am... a researcher here.</b>

18:47.580 --> 18:50.870
<b>They caught me when I was
exposing their experiments...</b>

18:51.500 --> 18:53.130
<b>Experiments? About what?</b>

18:53.670 --> 18:57.590
<b>XM. Exotic Matter.</b>

18:58.220 --> 18:59.680
<b>It’s a quantum substance.</b>

19:00.680 --> 19:02.720
<b>And they want to bend it to their will.</b>

19:03.260 --> 19:05.680
<b>And that’s, uh... a bad thing?</b>

19:06.350 --> 19:10.890
<b>XM. It has the capability to
directly affect the human mind.</b>

19:12.100 --> 19:15.270
<b>In their hands,
it will be used to betray humanity.</b>

19:16.690 --> 19:17.780
<b>We have to stop them!</b>

19:17.860 --> 19:20.150
<b>Stop them? Sarah!
Do you hear yourself?</b>

19:23.740 --> 19:24.740
<b>Oh... Sorry.</b>

19:26.370 --> 19:27.410
<b>The thing is...</b>

19:30.750 --> 19:33.790
<b>It’s so crazy,
even I wouldn’t believe it.</b>

19:35.210 --> 19:38.420
<b><i>That’s what I felt in the vision...</i>
<i>She’s like me...</i></b>

19:39.420 --> 19:42.930
<b><i>And she’s lost in all of this too.</i></b>

19:43.680 --> 19:44.510
<b>But...</b>

19:47.390 --> 19:48.220
<b>Makoto...</b>

19:49.060 --> 19:51.140
<b>I need you to believe.</b>

19:51.770 --> 19:56.020
<b>Because right now...
It’s us against the world.</b>

20:06.450 --> 20:07.280
<b>I believe you.</b>

20:15.130 --> 20:16.630
<b>Maybe we’re both crazy.</b>

20:27.350 --> 20:28.600
<b>We were unprepared.</b>

20:30.970 --> 20:33.520
<b>Who has her?
What are we dealing with?</b>

20:33.810 --> 20:34.940
<b>We don’t know.</b>

20:35.020 --> 20:38.730
<b>We think it was Brandt’s bodyguard and
the Japanese contractor hired by the cops.</b>

20:39.320 --> 20:41.440
<b>They say he can read
the memories of things...</b>

20:41.940 --> 20:43.530
<b>The psychic detective... Of course...</b>

20:47.990 --> 20:51.500
<b>You wanna go back inside Hulong?
It’s a crime scene! Your stuff’s there?</b>

20:52.330 --> 20:54.460
<b>Yeah. My phone, my wallet.</b>

20:54.920 --> 20:56.630
<b>My security access pass.</b>

20:57.540 --> 20:59.210
<b>Hopefully some clothes, too.</b>

21:02.510 --> 21:03.510
<b>It's him!</b>

21:04.470 --> 21:05.300
<b>What?</b>

21:08.600 --> 21:09.890
<b>-Makoto!
-Stay back!</b>

21:12.770 --> 21:15.230
<b>We’re gonna sort some things out...</b>

22:53.870 --> 22:55.870
<b>Subtitle Translation by Rika Takahashi</b>
